      "id": "claim_f12dbdbe23344518b15eaa7f7535a24a",
      "statement": "The dispatcher enforces a per-commit review cap: commit_review_count in task metadata is keyed to the PR head commit (headRefOid, reset when the head changes) and compared against ZEROFACTORY_MAX_REVIEW_ROUNDS (default 2); exceeding the cap sets review_cap_reached and blocked_reason_type='human-gate', assigns the task to 'human', and moves it to blocked instead of looping between builder and reviewer.",
